DESCRIPTION:The Longmont All Star Jazz Band is playing soft/quiet jazz!\nPerforming Live at The Passenger\nThe Passenger has food and drink specials until 6pm and an amazing menu otherwise! Check our this local band performing in our bar area!\nThe Longmont All-Star Jazz Band (LASJB) is comprised of the finest musicians from the greater Boulder County area currently enrolled in their local high school music programs who want to pursue a fun\, professional\, and challenging environment. The All-Stars aim to grow students' musical and interpersonal skills\, while giving them the opportunities to work together\, improvise\, and perform a wide variety of styles and genres within jazz.\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/longmont-all-star-jazz-band-free-performance-1
