BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:Discovery Days is an early childhood program that encourages children ages 2 to 6 and their caregivers to have fun together through educational\, hands-on art\, music\, and movement activities. When you attend Discovery Days at the Longmont Museum with your child\, you will help them cultivate important school-readiness skills\, such as language development\, attention\, concentration\, fine motor skills\, emotional regulation\, and play and social abilities.\nOccurs weekly on Tuesdays Jan. 13-May 5\, 2026. Three 45 minute-1 hour sessions available: 9:15am\, 10:45am\, and 1pm.\nAttend a session that fits your schedule\, no registration needed. Learn more online and explore weekly themes at https://longmontcolorado.gov/museum/education/discovery-days/ or by calling 303-651-8374.\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/discovery-days-music-and-movement-with-ms-ragen-5
DTEND:20260331T200000Z
LOCATION:Longmont Museum
DTSTART:20260331T151500Z
SUMMARY:🎵 Discovery Days: Music & Movement with Ms. Ragen
UID:152aae14-0058-482f-a014-e3e13b53b72f@152a.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:The Longmont All Star Jazz Band is playing soft/quiet jazz!\nPerforming Live at The Passenger\nThe Passenger has food and drink specials until 6pm and an amazing menu otherwise! Check our this local band performing in our bar area!\nThe Longmont All-Star Jazz Band (LASJB) is comprised of the finest musicians from the greater Boulder County area currently enrolled in their local high school music programs who want to pursue a fun\, professional\, and challenging environment. The All-Stars aim to grow students' musical and interpersonal skills\, while giving them the opportunities to work together\, improvise\, and perform a wide variety of styles and genres within jazz.\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/longmont-all-star-jazz-band-free-performance
DTEND:20260405T020000Z
LOCATION:The Passenger
DTSTART:20260404T230000Z
SUMMARY:🎵 [Jazz] Longmont All Star Jazz Band Free Performance!
UID:5b1e1c02-eeb6-4d36-9d12-cd4b09bd1ae0@5b1e.org
END:VEVENT
