DESCRIPTION:Lookin’ for Louie hits The Passenger at 5:30pm 🎸\nThree talented musicians bringing acoustic takes on classic rock hits—from today all the way back to the 50s. Expect killer guitar work\, smooth 3-part harmonies\, and all the feel-good vibes.\nCome early for happy hour until 6pm\, stay for the music\, and enjoy some seriously great food while you’re here.\nGood tunes\, good drinks\, great night—see you there ✨\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/lookin-for-louie-band-performing--the-passenger
