DESCRIPTION:✨ Vintage Vibes\, Elevated Lives ✨\nWe’re thrilled to announce our FIRST Annual Dinner Fundraiser & Fashion Show benefiting Elevated Communities!\n📅 Saturday\, April 11th\n🕔 5:00–8:00pm\n📍 Longmont’s Elks Lodge\nDinner\, fashion\, music\, dancing\, a silent auction—and a whole lot of heart 💛\nCome dressed in your favorite decade and help us raise funds for our Navigations Program.\n🎟 Tickets + tables available now!\nhttps://givebutter.com/vintagevibes\nCan't make it? You can still support Elevated Communities by donating to our Vintage Vibes fundraiser 💛 https://live.givebutter.com/c/vintagevibes\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/vintage-vibes-elevated-lives-first-annual-fundraiser-and-fashion-show
